    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers, or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nThis well presented two-bedroom apartment is located on the first floor of The Harbour Mill Complex at Westport Quay, with stunning views over Westport harbour and the mouth of Clew Bay.The floor area extends to approximately 83.5sq m/898.65 sq ft. Accommodation comprises of an entrance hall, a spacious open plan kitchen/living/dining room with the most stunning sea and harbour views, two double bedrooms (one en-suite) and a main bathroom. The property is presented in good condition throughout.This apartment would ideally suit someone looking to downsize close to all amenities or as an investment property/holiday home. The Quay is an attractive pedestrian friendly area with restaurants, bars, hotels and local shops. Westport House, one of Mayo's most popular visitor attractions is a five minute stroll away. Westport town centre and its many amenities are an easily walked 2 kilometres. Several popular beaches are a short drive from the apartment.\n\n********OFFERS IN EXCESS OF 285,000***********"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 6.8m x 1.0m\nPine Floor\n\nKitchen/ Living/ Dining Room - 6.43m x 2.9m\nPine floor, maple kitchen, integrated hob, formica worktop, tiled backsplash\n\n - 6.2m x 3.6m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.8m x 2.63m\nPine floor\n\nEn-Suite - 2.63m x 1.8m\nFully tiled, whb, bath/shower\n\nBedroom 2 - 5.0m x 2.7m\nPine floor\n\nBathroom - 2.7m x 1.8m\nLino Floor, tiled walls, whb, bath/shower\n\n"
      },
      {
